-- title:
--   Level drop at p ‖ M for q-expansion fields over Γ₀(ℓ)
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ be a field of characteristic $p$ for a prime $p$, let $M$ be a nonzero natural number with $p \mid M$ and $p^2 \nmid M$, and let $H$ be a subgroup of $(\mathbb Z/M)^\times$ with the property that every unit $u$ whose image under the reduction $(\mathbb Z/M)^\times \to (\mathbb Z/(M/p))^\times$ is trivial already lies in $H$. Let $\ell$ be a prime with $\ell \neq p$. Here, for a subgroup $\Gamma \le \mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb Z)$, [`ModularCurve.qExpFunctionFieldC K`](def/ModularCurve_X1.html#L101) $\Gamma$ denotes the intermediate field of $K(\!(q)\!)/K$ generated by all quotients $\mathrm{intSeriesC}\,K\,p_f/\mathrm{intSeriesC}\,K\,p_g$ with nonzero denominator, where $f,g$ are modular forms of one and the same weight $k$ for the image of $\Gamma$ in $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb R)$ and $p_f,p_g \in \mathbb Z[\![q]\!]$ are integral $q$-expansions of $f$ and $g$; and [`CohCarrier.GammaH L H'`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L133) is the subgroup of $\mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb Z)$ consisting of the matrices in $\Gamma_0(L)$ whose lower-right entry, read modulo $L$ as a unit, lies in $H'$. The assertion is that these intermediate fields agree for $\Gamma_H(M) \cap \Gamma_0(M\ell)$ and for $\Gamma_{H'}(M/p) \cap \Gamma_0((M/p)\ell)$, where $H' =$ [`ModularCurve.infSubgroup p M H hpM`](def/ModularCurve_XHDifferentialsModL.html#L246) is the image of $H$ under the reduction $(\mathbb Z/M)^\times \to (\mathbb Z/(M/p))^\times$.
--
--   This is the level-dropping statement at a prime exactly dividing the level, in characteristic $p$, transported to the $\ell$-Hecke roof: the $\Gamma_0(p)$-part of the level leaves no trace on the field generated by $q$-expansions at $\infty$. It is the companion at level $M\ell$ of the corresponding comparison at level $M$, and is used in the analysis of reduced root functions and Hecke operators modulo $\ell$ on differentials of $X_H$.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_qExpFunctionFieldC_gammaH_inf_gamma0_mul_eq_infSubgroup_inf_gamma0_mul_of_charP.lean

